{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"松拉回"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"松拉回"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>松拉回, 又叫<strong>有向纤维积</strong> (oriented fiber product), 是一种"},{"Local":{"url":"松极限","text":"松极限"}},{"Plain":", 是"},{"Local":{"url":"拉回","text":"拉回"}},{"Plain":" (纤维积) 在"},{"Local":{"url":"高阶范畴","text":"高阶范畴"}},{"Plain":"中的推广.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n"}]}}